    <p>
        This site uses handwritten HTML, CSS and JS and does not use any frontend frameworks.
        The source code was not generated by a large language model (LLM).
    </p>

    <details>
        <summary>1: Why »ZugBahnHof«?</summary>
        <p>
            The name doesn't carry any necessary meaning, it was just the first thing I could think of when creating
            my GitHub account, back in sixth grade.
        </p>
        <p>
            It can be translated as »TrainTrainStation«.
            While I do enjoy taking trains, I do not have a heightened interest in them, even if the name might
            suggest otherwise.
        </p>
    </details>
